%% AI question answering sequence -> docs/wiki/images/i1-ai-answer-sequence.png
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Consumer app
  participant API as FastAPI messaging router
  participant SV as messaging service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant AI as ai adapter
  participant CL as Claude Haiku 4.5
  C->>API: POST /api/messaging/chats/{farmId}/messages
  API->>SV: consumer_send(consumer, farmId, body)
  SV->>DB: lock Thread row, save masked question
  SV->>DB: read farm AI settings and thread mode
  alt AI off or thread is HUMAN
    SV-->>API: question saved, reply = null
  else handoff topic (pesticide, refund, taste, damage)
    SV->>DB: create Escalation (FORWARDED)
  else AUTO and AI on
    SV->>AI: answer_question(question, evidence)
    AI->>AI: rule-based answer for known facts
    opt no rule answer and API key set
      AI->>CL: question + selected evidence (no personal data)
      CL-->>AI: ANSWER or HANDOFF
    end
    AI-->>SV: answer with sources, or handoff
    SV->>DB: recheck mode and settings version
    SV->>DB: save AI message or Escalation
  end
  SV-->>API: SendResult(message, reply)
  API-->>C: 200 JSON
  Note over C,API: open chat screens poll every 2 seconds for new messages
